  "findings": [
    "There is no single stable official Makati park count across the reviewed publications.",
    "Detailed named inventories and annual headline counts conflict even within the 2020 publication period, so BetterMakati must retain source/vintage context.",
    "The 2010 DES inventory contains names absent from the 2020 public-park table; 2022 procurement proves several older names remained operationally relevant.",
    "The 2020 detailed public/private tables use classifications that differ from the older 18-park urban-greening map.",
    "The 2023 DES count explicitly excludes the 10 transferred barangays, making it the best headline count currently found for post-transfer geography, but it does not provide a named 15-park list."
  ],
